@When "^perform the Novation Remaining event on the '([^']*)' trade$"
    When opens lifecycle action 'novation remaining' for current trade
    And component dynamic action types novation remaining target amount from stored variable 'targetAmount' if it is set
    And component dynamic action selects counterparty from stored variable 'newCptyName'
    And submits 'novation remaining' lifecycle event and stores the new trade id

@Then "^the novation remaining is completed successfully$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and title as '${json-unit.regex}Novation completed. Original trade .* terminated.'
